1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:02,659
Hey, I don't mean to interrupt
your little game...

2
00:00:02,828 --> 00:00:07,928
(Penny(entering):)...but I thought you'd like to see what
you're missing out on. So, ahem, Bernadette?

3
00:00:13,672 --> 00:00:18,772
(Penny(entering):)Bernadette's wearing leopard-print pumps
and a racktastic red dress from Forever 21.

4
00:00:25,317 --> 00:00:27,977
(Penny(entering):)And there's Amy showing
all kinds of ankle...

5
00:00:29,521 --> 00:00:32,981
(Penny(entering):)...in an outfit I'm assuming
is from Forever 63.

6
00:00:34,793 --> 00:00:37,283
(Penny(entering):)And I myself...

7
00:00:39,131 --> 00:00:43,401
(Penny(entering):)...am wearing a little number that got me
out of two speeding tickets and jury duty.

8
00:00:44,737 --> 00:00:48,637
(Sheldon:)I know they're making a rhetorical point,
I just don't know what it is.

9
00:00:48,807 --> 00:00:50,537
(Penny:)See you, boys. We are going drinking.

10
00:00:50,709 --> 00:00:55,019
(Raj:)Wait. Can I come with you?
My character died.

